kit_prompt_prefix:
Generate ONLY public/words.js — a themed word list for a crossword puzzle.

The game engine (index.html) builds the crossword grid automatically from this word list.

Generate a JavaScript file that defines var WORD_LISTS with three difficulty levels.
Each level has 10-15 words with clues matching the user's theme.

EXACT FORMAT (follow precisely):

var WORD_LISTS = {
  easy: [
    {word:'WORD1',clue:'Clue for word 1'},
    {word:'WORD2',clue:'Clue for word 2'},
    // 10-12 words, 3-5 letters each
  ],
  medium: [
    {word:'LONGER1',clue:'Clue for longer word'},
    // 12-15 words, 4-7 letters each
  ],
  hard: [
    {word:'VERYLONG1',clue:'Clue for challenging word'},
    // 12-17 words, 5-10 letters each
  ]
};

RULES:
- ALL words UPPERCASE, letters only (A-Z), no spaces or hyphens
- Easy: short common words (3-5 letters)
- Medium: moderate words (4-7 letters)
- Hard: longer/challenging words (5-10 letters)
- Clues must be concise (under 50 chars) and match the theme
- Include a mix of across-friendly and down-friendly word lengths
- Words should share common letters (E,A,T,O,R,S,N,I) to enable crossings
- Do NOT generate index.html, server.js, or any other file
